t the required flags,\n(e.g. deadline abc), then a java.lang.NullPointerException is thrown,\ncrashing the program.\n\nThis is because if the flag is not present, flagValues.get(flag) is\nnull, so .isEmpty() is called on a null value in\nAddDeadlineTask::from() and AddEventTask::from(), causing the\nNullPointerException.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":25,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"d1ebd93291b8f0df7f65b4a269ec0f83d425c96d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AGENTS.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"e164e67acdca3bde3118e47e637eafa90ff7e265","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix whitespace treated as todo command","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-4"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"4504987d493c9e992b06482f36bfbfa28ae641ab","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add test-ui skill","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":7,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"ecd491ecba94c7ee382734cd446ac4396e62e0ec","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Track UI test plan for test-ui skill","messageBody":"The UI test plan was stored under ignored Codex configuration,\nso it was not reproducible or shareable with the project.\n\nMove it to test/ui-test-plan.md and update the relevant project\ninstructions and skill references.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":339,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"323e4de540962f70e5767166c17f30ec6e18f604","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix unknown command defaulting to todo command","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-5"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"001fc0c895f5681337ed9b0c70da2dd6aec67cc9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add support for delete command","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":68,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"a805a2ac2039b027b9d10667c2fe5d36c40602ea","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTi